  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "台灣文學",
    "sub_ename": "TAIWANESE LITERATURE",
    "describe_ch": "探討台灣文學的內容與精神，包括三大領域：一、原住民文學（口傳文學與八Ｏ年代以後原住民文學；二、古典文學（明鄭、清領、日治）；三、日治時期新文學（新詩與小說）。",
    "describe_eh": "The course will examine the content and spirit of Taiwanese literature. It will cover three aspects, namely, the literature of original inhabitants in Taiwan (oral literature and literature of original inhabitants from 1980's), classical literature (Periods of Mingzheng, Qing and Japanese occupation), and lastly, new literature in the period of Japanese government (modern poems and fictions).",
